<title>USA: Rorer says no Dec. 11 announcement planned.</title>
<headline>Rorer says no Dec. 11 announcement planned.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rhone-Poulenc Rorer Inc said on Tuesday it had no plans to make a news announcement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Earlier, a public relations agency in Paris said a French pharmaceuticals company and another firm would announce details of a deal early Wednesday. It gave no details.</p>
<p>&quot;We don't have an announcement scheduled for tomorrow,&quot; a U.S.-based Rorer spokesman said. He had no further comment.</p>
</text>
